---
source: tests/relogin.rs
expression: s
---
--- nothing set: a TTY, ssh, a timer
  NO  session  XDG_RUNTIME_DIR is not set, so there is no session here to find
               WAYLAND_DISPLAY is not set: this ricepilot is not running inside a graphical session
               (a TTY, ssh, a timer), and `uwsm stop` would end a session you are not looking at
               DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS is not set: uwsm asks systemd for the logout over the session
               bus, and without one `uwsm stop` has nothing to ask

--- no WAYLAND_DISPLAY
  NO  session  WAYLAND_DISPLAY is not set: this ricepilot is not running inside a graphical session
               (a TTY, ssh, a timer), and `uwsm stop` would end a session you are not looking at

--- no session bus
  NO  session  DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS is not set: uwsm asks systemd for the logout over the session
               bus, and without one `uwsm stop` has nothing to ask

--- the runtime directory is the real one, outside the sandbox
  NO  session  XDG_RUNTIME_DIR=/run/user/1000 is outside the test sandbox <SANDBOX>.
               inside the sandbox ricepilot reads no real session's state (D56)

--- WAYLAND_DISPLAY is a path
  NO  session  WAYLAND_DISPLAY=/elsewhere/wayland-0 is not a plain socket name.
               ricepilot looks for the socket only in XDG_RUNTIME_DIR

--- WAYLAND_DISPLAY names no socket
  NO  session  WAYLAND_DISPLAY=wayland-9 names no socket in XDG_RUNTIME_DIR: no compositor is listening there

--- WAYLAND_DISPLAY names a regular file
  NO  session  WAYLAND_DISPLAY=wayland-file: what is at that name in XDG_RUNTIME_DIR is not a socket

--- no uwsm unit: a session uwsm did not start
  NO  session  no uwsm compositor unit (`wayland-wm@….service`) is running for this user —
               <HOME>/.run/systemd/units records none. this session is not managed by uwsm, and
               `uwsm stop` is the only logout ricepilot runs: never `hyprctl dispatch exit`, never
               a signal to Hyprland. log out the way you logged in

--- two uwsm units
  NO  session  more than one uwsm compositor unit is running: wayland-wm@hyprland.desktop.service, wayland-wm@sway.desktop.service.
               `uwsm stop` would stop one of them, and ricepilot will not guess which one is this session

--- over ssh
  NO  session  the environment has SSH_CONNECTION, SSH_TTY: this ricepilot was started over ssh, and `uwsm stop`
               would end a graphical session on another screen, not the one you are looking at

--- over ssh, SSH_CLIENT alone
  NO  session  the environment has SSH_CLIENT: this ricepilot was started over ssh, and `uwsm stop`
               would end a graphical session on another screen, not the one you are looking at

--- inside tmux: attached from who knows where
  NO  session  the environment has TMUX: this ricepilot runs inside tmux, screen or zellij, whose
               pane has the environment of the session its server started in — but you may be
               attached from a TTY or over ssh, and nothing a pane can read says which. run it
               from a terminal in the session itself, outside the multiplexer

--- inside screen
  NO  session  the environment has STY: this ricepilot runs inside tmux, screen or zellij, whose
               pane has the environment of the session its server started in — but you may be
               attached from a TTY or over ssh, and nothing a pane can read says which. run it
               from a terminal in the session itself, outside the multiplexer

--- inside zellij
  NO  session  the environment has ZELLIJ: this ricepilot runs inside tmux, screen or zellij, whose
               pane has the environment of the session its server started in — but you may be
               attached from a TTY or over ssh, and nothing a pane can read says which. run it
               from a terminal in the session itself, outside the multiplexer
